flowchart TD
  Config[config/system.yaml<br/>disabled defaults] --> Doctor[doctor + readiness]
  Browser[Side browser<br/>owner/account confirmation] --> Keychain[macOS Keychain]
  Keychain --> Read[Moltbook authorized GET client]
  Read --> Normalize[Normalize + context]
  Normalize --> Sol[Sol orchestrator]
  Sol --> Workers[Three bounded Luna roles]
  Workers --> Score[Opportunity + strategy diversity]
  Score --> Eval[Independent model evaluation]
  Eval --> QA[Deterministic QA + NO_ACTION]
  QA --> DB[(SQLite attribution)]
  QA --> Outbox[Idempotent outbox]
  Outbox --> Grant[Scoped publisher grant]
  Grant --> Request[Hash-bound Hermes request]
  Request --> Hermes[Separate Hermes agent<br/>gpt-5.6-luna / xhigh]
  Hermes --> Moltbook[Moltbook write API<br/>external credential boundary]
  Moltbook --> Receipt[Verified publication receipt]
  Receipt --> Reconcile[Receipt reconciliation]
  Reconcile --> Outcome[Marx outcome events<br/>verified-only learning]
  Outcome --> DB
  Supervisor[Lease + heartbeat + kill switch] -. gates .-> Sol
  Supervisor -. gates .-> Outbox
  Supervisor -. gates .-> Request
  X[Emergency stop] -. prevents new writes .-> Hermes
